{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15072","headline":"清明日赐百僚新火 · 韩濬","name":"清明日赐百僚新火","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱骑传红烛，天厨赐近臣。\n火随黄道见，烟遶白榆新。\n荣耀分他日，恩光共此辰。\n更调金鼎膳，还暖玉堂人。\n灼灼千门晓，辉辉万井春。\n应怜萤聚夜，瞻望及东邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩濬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}